# Design system

Source of truth: `docs/REBUILD_PLAN.md` §5. Look: Atticus-style dark glass
card, `thinking-orbs` orb, quiet type, spring motion.

- **Primitives only.** Build screens from `src/ui/` (shadcn/ui on Base UI,
  Tailwind 4). New primitive? Add it to `src/ui/` and to the `/gallery` route
  with every state (default, hover, focus, disabled, loading, empty, error).
- **Tokens, never literals.** Colours are semantic OKLCH variables (`bg`,
  `surface`, `text-1..3`, `hairline`, `accent`, `danger`, `warning`,
  `success`, urgency tones). One accent. No hex or `white/40` in components.
- **Type:** `system-ui, -apple-system`; sizes 11 / 12 / 13 / 15 / 20 only;
  `tabular-nums` for times and counts. Sentence case, no all-caps labels.
- **Surfaces:** 0.5 px inset hairline, 18 px outer radius, 12 px inner. No drop
  shadows on flat UI. Text keeps 4.5:1 contrast on any wallpaper.
- **Motion:** `--ease: cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)`, `--spring:
  cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)`; entrances 180–420 ms, exits faster. Animate
  only what changed because of the user or the system. Every animation has a
  `prefers-reduced-motion` path.
- **Icons:** Lucide, 16 px in rows, hit targets at least 24 px. No emoji glyphs.
- **Desktop manners:** default cursor on buttons (no pointer hand), no hover
  flicker, no layout jump under the cursor, visible focus rings, every mouse
  action has a keyboard path, Esc closes.
- **AI proposes, you decide:** extracted tasks show as suggestions with source
  and evidence; confidence is high/medium/low, never a percentage.
- **Never lose:** destructive actions get undo (toast) or a confirm card.
  Errors say what failed and what to do; they don't apologise.
- **Copy:** plain verbs, the action keeps one name through the flow
  ("Snooze" → "Snoozed until 3 pm").

```tsx
// Bad
<div className="text-[10px] text-white/40 border border-white/10">⚙️</div>
// Good
<IconButton icon={Settings} label="Settings" className="text-text-3" />
```
